### Public submission — use fictional test information only
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/recruitment/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name":"Ứng viên thử nghiệm","email":"applicant@example.com","phone":"0977112233","student_id":"TEST11210001","position":"shipper","availability":["mon-morning","mon-afternoon","wed-morning","fri-afternoon"],"intro":"Hồ sơ kiểm thử"}

### Manager list — supply your own access token locally
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/recruitment/applications?status=pending&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_access_token}}

### Employee records
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/recruitment/employees?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_access_token}}
